# Copy to .env (already gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Not read directly by this codebase -- the `anthropic` SDK picks this up
# automatically when AnthropicClient is constructed without an explicit
# api_key. Required to run `uv run lulu` against a real model; not needed
# to run the test suite (all 235 tests mock the SDK, no key required).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Future model adapters (OpenRouter, Ollama -- see ROADMAP.md) will add
# their own variables here once they exist. Nothing below this line is
# read by any code today.
